@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/lane#> .
@prefix courier: <http://example.org/orexis/courier#> .
@prefix planning: <http://example.org/orexis/planning#> .

<> a planning:ConstraintGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  WHO HOLDS THE COURIER'S CONSTRAINTS (domains/courier/constraints.ttl): both couriers, so neither plans a van onto
#  a cell the other's stands on, nor onto an obstacle. The road states what no van does and knows no agent;
#  which agents hold it is this world's to say.

:courier_a planning:holds courier:no_two_vans_at_one_position , courier:no_van_on_an_obstacle .
:courier_b planning:holds courier:no_two_vans_at_one_position , courier:no_van_on_an_obstacle .
